{
  "name": "Audio Amplifier – Class D with Volume Control",
  "description": "A stereo Class-D audio amplifier board based on the PAM8403 (5 V, 3 W × 2) with logarithmic potentiometer volume control, input coupling capacitors, and ferrite-bead EMI filters on the speaker outputs. Covers audio signal coupling, Class-D switching noise suppression, and power supply decoupling for audio circuits.",
  "components": [
